@zomato WHAT A COMPLETE DISGRACE! 🤬

Your delivery partner spilled the ENTIRE FANTA inside our food delivery bag, ruining the entire order and making every single item completely inedible. And what’s Zomato’s brilliant solution? “Our team will get back to you within 48 hours.”

ARE YOU SERIOUS? We paid for food, not for a bag full of spilled soft drink and ruined meals! Why should customers suffer because of YOUR delivery negligence?

Instead of taking accountability and issuing an immediate refund, your customer support gives us scripted responses and asks us to WAIT 48 HOURS. Absolutely pathetic customer service!

At this point, ordering from Zomato feels like a gamble. You happily take customers’ money but disappear when something goes wrong. Swiggy is miles ahead when it comes to handling customer complaints.

@zomato STOP MAKING CUSTOMERS BEG FOR THEIR OWN MONEY BACK! Take responsibility, stop giving useless excuses, and ISSUE A FULL REFUND IMMEDIATELY.

@deepigoyal SHAMEFUL EXPERIENCE. WORST CUSTOMER SERVICE! 🤬

@deepigoyal @zomato thank you for all your efforts. Just one small request, I am writing to share feedback regarding your Project ZEAL initiative. I recently met one of your delivery partners who uses a motorized wheelchair. Speaking with her was inspiring, and I deeply appreciate @Zomato providing these equitable livelihood opportunities.
During our conversation, she shared a major challenge she faces daily: when delivering to high rise apartments or for some customers, she frequently faces impatience and harsh words from residents (not blaming anyone here) because it takes her longer time to reach their doors.
While the app notifies customers about their delivery partner's disability, the current system still relies entirely on the customer’s voluntary willingness to walk down. please find a solution. Thank you 🙏
